      "comparison": "The current-product account and complete service-matched route comparison answer different questions. Ekvall Figure3 is a hypothetical inversion with a quality-reference difference as well as different weights. Its Swedish renewable-LDPE baseline retains lower climate impact for mechanical recycling under both examined calculations. Neither is a Danish-paper result or universal recovery ranking.",
