      "rules": "The2018 default and Commission consideration of proposed values, the2022 B=0 default with applicable Part C exception and no-double-counting requirement, and the paper’s Swedish B≈0.6 proposal stay separately attributed. B changes a net reporting share. A fixed-total-feed-energy crowd-out scenario changes the activity inventory; equal total energy does not require equal energy per kilogram, and unchanged delivered heat/electricity also needs unchanged conversion/delivery conditions.",
